Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pairagraph â€” a simple place to read, practice, and try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Before reading, review the microphone prompt and give permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tick the consent box, then choose Record.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The story appears when recording starts. Read aloud at your own pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Make the text larger when needed. Stop stays at the bottom center.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,After Stop: choose peach Record again, or green See how I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A spinning circle shows that your results are loading.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendly feedback suggests a few practice words. The AI can mishear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Open Look at my reading to compare the story with what was heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One clear next step: Read this story. Or take a break.
